# Architecture Overview

{info:title=System Architecture Overview}
The PostgreSQL Blockchain Extension implements a sophisticated multi-layered architecture that transforms PostgreSQL into a blockchain-enabled database system. This section provides comprehensive technical documentation of all architectural components.
{info}

{toc:printable=true|style=disc|maxLevel=3}

## System Architecture Diagram

{panel:title=High-Level Architecture|borderColor=#2196F3|titleBGColor=#E3F2FD}
```
Application Layer
├── SQL Interface
├── Applications  
└── Admin Tools
    ↓
PostgreSQL Core + Blockchain Extension
├── Parser Layer
│   ├── SQL Parser
│   └── Blockchain Grammar Extensions
├── Query Processing
│   ├── Query Planner
│   ├── Query Executor
│   └── Blockchain Hooks
├── Blockchain Components
│   ├── Blockchain Table Access Method ← Core Component
│   ├── Hash Chain Engine ← Cryptographic Layer
│   ├── Global Counter System ← Sequencing Layer
│   ├── Immutability Protection ← Security Layer
│   └── System Column Manager ← Metadata Layer
└── Storage Layer
    ├── Heap Storage
    ├── Write-Ahead Log
    └── Buffer Management
    ↓
Persistence
├── Data Files
├── Counter Files
└── WAL Files
```
{panel}

## Core Components

{section}
{column:width=50%}
{panel:title=🗄️ Blockchain Table Access Method (TAM)|borderColor=#673AB7|titleBGColor=#EDE7F6}
The heart of the system that implements PostgreSQL's Table Access Method interface with blockchain-specific extensions.

**Key Features:**
* Full PostgreSQL TAM compliance
* Automatic system column injection
* Immutable tuple operations
* Seamless SQL integration

[Learn More|Architecture - Blockchain Table Access Method]
{panel}

{panel:title=🔢 Global Counter System|borderColor=#4CAF50|titleBGColor=#E8F5E8}
Sophisticated counter management providing unique sequential numbering across all blockchain tables.

**Key Features:**
* Shared memory architecture
* Lazy recovery mechanisms
* Atomic counter operations
* Persistent state management

[Learn More|Architecture - Counter Management]
{panel}
{column}

{column:width=50%}
{panel:title=🔗 Hash Chain Engine|borderColor=#E91E63|titleBGColor=#FCE4EC}
Cryptographic integrity system providing tamper-evident storage through SHA-256 hash chaining.

**Key Features:**
* SHA-256 cryptographic hashing
* Chain-based data linking
* Tamper detection capabilities
* Cross-platform consistency

[Learn More|Architecture - Hash Chain System]
{panel}

{panel:title=🛡️ Immutability Enforcement|borderColor=#FF5722|titleBGColor=#FBE9E7}
Multi-layer protection system ensuring complete immutability through defense-in-depth approach.

**Protection Layers:**
1. Parser-level syntax validation
2. Utility hook DDL interception
3. TAM-level operation blocking
4. System column access control

[Learn More|Architecture - Immutability Enforcement]
{panel}
{column}
{section}

